@startuml PayPal Honey Extension - Communication Flows

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shading false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF2CC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #D6B656
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #6C8EBF

actor User
participant "E-Commerce Page\n(Isolated World)" as Page
participant "Content Script\n(h1-check.js)" as Content
participant "Popover UI\n(popover.html / h1-popover.js)" as Popover
participant "Background Worker\n(h0.js)" as Background
participant "Offscreen Doc\n(offscreen.html / h1-offscreen.js)" as Offscreen
database "Storage\n(chrome.storage.local)" as Storage
entity "Honey Telemetry\n(s.joinhoney.com)" as Telemetry
entity "Recipe API\n(v.joinhoney.com)" as RecipeServer
entity "PayPal Auth\n(paypal.com)" as PayPal

' 1. Navigation and Supported Check Flow
User -> Page : Navigates to shopping site
Page -> Content : Executes on document_end
Content -> Background : content->background (onMessage: check Supported Store)
note right: Payload: { url: location.href, referrer: document.referrer }
Background -> Storage : Check local cached merchant maps
Background -> Content : background->content (Supported status & active recipes)

' 2. Configuration & Standdown Rules Fetching
Background -> Telemetry : GET standdown-rules.json & coiny-dash-config.json
Telemetry --> Background : Rules schema, animation parameters

' 3. Telemetry Event Reporting
Content -> Background : content->background (Send Telemetry Event)
note right: Action tracking, user activity payload
Background -> Telemetry : POST /evs (with user identifiers, URL & referrer)
Background -> Telemetry : POST /ev/${code} (Immediate event reporting)

' 4. Popup & Authentication Flow
User -> Popover : Clicks extension icon
Popover -> Background : ui->background (Get user state & rewards details)
Background -> Storage : Get cached user tokens and details
Background --> Popover : User profile and PayPal gold status
Popover -> PayPal : Sync PayPal rewards & accounts
note right: Target: history.paypal.com/targeting/set-plugin

' 5. Coupon Finder Automation Flow
User -> Popover : Clicks "Apply Coupons"
Popover -> Background : ui->background (Trigger Coupon Finder)
Background -> RecipeServer : Fetch store recipes (VIM scripts) from v.joinhoney.com
RecipeServer --> Background : Recipe JSON
Background -> Content : Inject coupon automation scripts (using chrome.scripting or proxy)
loop For each coupon code
  Content -> Page : Inject code in checkout form
  Content -> Page : Submit form & wait for AJAX update
  Content -> Page : Parse discounted cart total
end
Content --> Background : Best coupon found with total savings
Background -> Storage : Persist savings and applied code
Background -> Telemetry : POST /pr (Report coupon success/failure and cart details)
Background -> Content : background->content (Success UI notification)
Content -> User : Displays "You saved $X!" popup

@enduml
